WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.153
Mole lay on the riverbank.

2
00:00:04.154 --> 00:00:07.408
Rat was away visiting Otter.

3
00:00:07.409 --> 00:00:12.233
"Oh, why didn't I go with Rat?" said Mole.

4
00:00:12.234 --> 00:00:16.959
"He's late, and now the sun is setting."

5
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.014
At last Mole heard Rat's footsteps.

6
00:00:21.015 --> 00:00:23.439
Rat sat down beside him.

7
00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.306
"Why did you stay so long?" asked Mole.

8
00:00:27.307 --> 00:00:29.730
"I had to," said Rat.

9
00:00:29.731 --> 00:00:32.079
"Otter is in trouble."

10
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.740
"What is it?" asked Mole.

11
00:00:34.741 --> 00:00:38.735
"Otter's son, Little Portly," said Rat.

12
00:00:38.736 --> 00:00:41.843
"He's missing again."

13
00:00:41.844 --> 00:00:46.474
"Oh, Portly is always running off," said Mole.

14
00:00:46.475 --> 00:00:49.252
"I know," said Rat.

15
00:00:49.253 --> 00:00:53.058
"And he always comes back," said Mole.

16
00:00:53.059 --> 00:00:58.278
"But Portly has been missing for days," said Rat.

17
00:00:58.279 --> 00:01:01.979
Mole listened closely to Rat's news.

18
00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:05.158
"Otter looked everywhere," said Rat.

19
00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:07.824
"He asked every animal.

20
00:01:07.825 --> 00:01:11.877
No one saw Little Portly anywhere."

21
00:01:11.878 --> 00:01:15.142
"What will Otter do?" asked Mole.

22
00:01:15.143 --> 00:01:19.139
"Otter goes to the old bridge," said Rat.

23
00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:22.176
"He taught Portly to swim there.

24
00:01:22.177 --> 00:01:25.947
Portly caught his first fish there too."

25
00:01:25.948 --> 00:01:30.464
"It's a place Portly remembers," said Mole.

26
00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:35.110
"Yes, Portly loves the old bridge," said Rat.

27
00:01:35.111 --> 00:01:38.011
"Otter waits there every night."

28
00:01:38.012 --> 00:01:44.925
Rat and Mole sat quietly for a while.

29
00:01:44.926 --> 00:01:48.603
They both imagined Otter at the bridge.

30
00:01:48.604 --> 00:01:52.812
They thought of him worrying all night.

31
00:01:52.813 --> 00:01:58.489
"Rat," said Mole, "we just can't go to bed."

32
00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:00.895
"I agree," said Rat.

33
00:02:00.896 --> 00:02:05.111
"Let's find Portly."

